---
/**
 * @category Feature
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Feature3
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='flex flex-col gap-14 md:gap-20'>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-8'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:col-span-7 md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Change it where you see it</h2>
      <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty md:col-span-5 dark:text-stone-400'>Select anything on the canvas and the Design panel shows its real Tailwind classes. Change a value and the file changes with it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8'>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Tune every breakpoint</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Give phones, tablets and wide screens their own padding, type size or columns. Each value is saved as a Tailwind class with its breakpoint prefix.</p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Drag to reorder</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Move a section up the page or a card to the front of its row. The markup moves in the file too.</p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Swap images</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Drop a new picture onto an old one. The size, crop and rounded corners stay, and the alt text is one click away.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
